[{"title":"彦文携玉友见过出示致道小诗因次其韵 其二","author":"赵鼎","text":"仙官新拜旧词臣，林下相逢又一人。\n勿谓沧浪清可濯，此心原自绝纤尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14196,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"彦文携玉友见过出示致道小诗因次其韵 其三","author":"赵鼎","text":"于世无功懒据鞍，诛茅种竹老空山。\n不应天与静中趣，自是人容拙者闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14197,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题","author":"赵鼎","text":"胶胶身世竟何穷，急电飞花过眼空。\n惟有离愁推不去，五更孤枕角声中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14198,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再书一绝","author":"赵鼎","text":"吴九何如黄四娘，能令诗老醉颠狂。\n可怜去岁花前客，戎马尘埃两鬓霜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14199,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元长谒仲长彦文赠以樽酒","author":"赵鼎","text":"杖头挑取一壶春，要使朱颜日日新。\n何必稽山寻贺老，风流俱是谪仙人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14200,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"范元长寄示刘野夫满庭芳曲因用其语戏呈","author":"赵鼎","text":"暮年身计酒葫芦，定是前身刘野夫。\n他日烂柯山下见，俨然一部黑髭须。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14201,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元长观梅三首 其一","author":"赵鼎","text":"曳杖山间自探春，雨馀梅意已清新。\n兵戎草草伤沦落，一醉花前有几人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14202,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元长观梅三首 其二","author":"赵鼎","text":"种柳栽花旧惜春，不知春色为谁新。\n年年青眼樽前客，只有寒梅是故人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14203,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元长观梅三首 其三","author":"赵鼎","text":"归来醉撚一枝春，照影凉蟾过雨新。\n不似霸陵愁醉尉，穿云渡水寂无人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14204,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"建康得家书寄元长观梅诗因次其韵","author":"赵鼎","text":"东风一纸平安信，闻道黄岗春已来。\n传语吴生好看客，梅花应似去年开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14205,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"枕上","author":"赵鼎","text":"市楼春睡厌都城，车毂喧喧枕上声。\n此夜客情还冷淡，一林风露夏鸡鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14206,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦觉 其一","author":"赵鼎","text":"竹枕藤床一室虚，松风瑟瑟梦惊馀。\n破窗犹有流萤渡，老我疏慵不读书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14207,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦觉 其二","author":"赵鼎","text":"老去人怜百病攻，平生感慨竟谁同。\n须知一点悬悬念，不在功名富贵中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14208,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦觉 其三","author":"赵鼎","text":"虚窗午夜月朦胧，推枕萧然百念空。\n更问幽人洗心法，二年魂梦水声中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14209,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泊白鹭洲时辛道宗兵溃犯金陵境上金陵守不得入 其一","author":"赵鼎","text":"脱迹干戈幸再生，时时心折梦围城。\n南来客枕能安否，更作江湖盗贼惊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14210,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泊白鹭洲时辛道宗兵溃犯金陵境上金陵守不得入 其二","author":"赵鼎","text":"城头传令插军麾，城外行人泪满衣。\n处处悲风吹战角，沙洲白鹭莫惊飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14211,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泊白鹭洲时辛道宗兵溃犯金陵境上金陵守不得入 其三","author":"赵鼎","text":"月满沧江风水清，沉沉冰鉴照孤城。\n何人心绪犹无事，醉卧船舷一笛横。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14212,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泊盈川步头舟中酌酒五首 其一","author":"赵鼎","text":"那知乱后年光促，但觉春来酒味长。\n炯炯新蟾照人白，恨无双竹倩孙郎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14213,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泊盈川步头舟中酌酒五首 其二","author":"赵鼎","text":"空笼影照琉璃滑，鸿洞声传钟鼓长。\n便买扁舟作家宅，风流千载谢三郎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14214,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泊盈川步头舟中酌酒五首 其三","author":"赵鼎","text":"飞扬跋扈今安取，放浪酣歌亦所长。\n曾醉西湖春色否，传声江上问诸郎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14215,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泊盈川步头舟中酌酒五首 其四","author":"赵鼎","text":"苍苍烟画千岩秀，泛泛花流一水长。\n会向武陵寻避世，此身已是捕鱼郎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14216,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泊盈川步头舟中酌酒五首 其五","author":"赵鼎","text":"收功不在干戈众，和议元非计策长。\n闻道搜贤遍南国，要令四裔识周郎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14217,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乙卯秋闻右相平杨么作绝句寄之","author":"赵鼎","text":"一扫湖湘氛祲消，坐令愁叹变歌谣。\n何当早驾风帆下，来看钱塘八月潮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14218,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丁酉春绍兴书怀","author":"赵鼎","text":"贺监湖边树树花，东风随意作纷华。\n那知老守怀归切，陇水秦云是我家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14219,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张汝霖纠左冯翊六绝 其一","author":"赵鼎","text":"风流幕府固多闲，冷落曹司绝往还。\n举酒高楼谁作伴，何妨借取华州山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14220,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张汝霖纠左冯翊六绝 其二","author":"赵鼎","text":"平岳亭高一望间，烟霞缥缈揖飞仙。\n请君直跨刚风骑，去折山头十丈莲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14221,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张汝霖纠左冯翊六绝 其三","author":"赵鼎","text":"堂前双树小桃枝，曾看芳英落酒卮。\n要识当时花下客，鬓毛衰飒病支离。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14222,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张汝霖纠左冯翊六绝 其四","author":"赵鼎","text":"花发城南苑路迷，衫裁白纻马如飞。\n月明洛水黄昏后，犹有游人唤渡归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14223,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张汝霖纠左冯翊六绝 其五","author":"赵鼎","text":"瓮面浮醅玉雪光，陶巾犹带漉时香。\n何当分我腊馀味，试发樽前旧态狂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14224,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张汝霖纠左冯翊六绝 其六","author":"赵鼎","text":"平时三辅盛他邦，白面青山意气郎。\n落魄朋游那复问，更将苦语话离肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14225,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病愈","author":"赵鼎","text":"支离瘦骨怯寒侵，雾雨溟溟山更深。\n医国无功还自治，暮年药裹最关心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14226,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"独坐东轩","author":"赵鼎","text":"云山环合户深关，中有幽人竟日闲。\n好在窗前数竿竹，与君相伴老山间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14227,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"潮阳容老出游闽浙过泉南当谒涌老禅师因寄四句偈","author":"赵鼎","text":"老矣潮州韩吏部，饥餐渴饮似当年。\n明明月夜长相照，莫怪无书寄大颠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14228,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吉阳寄李泰发","author":"赵鼎","text":"海风吹浪去如飞，离母山高日出迟。\n此意此情谁会得，因书写与故人知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14229,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄李参政","author":"赵鼎","text":"海风飘荡水云飞，黎母山高月上迟。\n千里孤光一樽酒，此情惟有故人知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14230,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和郑有功游西湖二首 其一","author":"赵鼎","text":"放舟越淮楚，更作三吴游。\n尚馀魂梦怖，敢动乡邦愁。\n湖山自清绝，鉴中螺髻浮。\n况复得夫子，一笑忘幽忧。\n时时作清言，中有湖山秋。\n却念无家客，坎止而乘流。\n何当与俱归，岁晚邻一丘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14231,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和郑有功游西湖二首 其二","author":"赵鼎","text":"晚觉身名误，悠悠定孰亲。\n却回苕水棹，来看武林春。\n避地将安往，寻山莫厌频。\n百钱挑竹杖，云外踏嶙峋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14232,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"明庆僧房夜坐","author":"赵鼎","text":"月明窗竹冷横斜，坐看风灯落烬花。\n老眼病馀嫌细字，枯肠寒甚怯清茶。\n囊空岂是久为客，梦短其能飞到家。\n但有流年寻鬓发，潇潇蓬葆飒霜华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14233,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"趋三衢别故人时车驾幸杭州 其一","author":"赵鼎","text":"伧父何由习楚风，家山俱在古河东。\n相逢憔悴干戈后，追数悲欢梦寐中。\n掺袂又成千里别，放歌空念一尊同。\n他年倘有加餐字，试问渔舟鹤发翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14234,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"趋三衢别故人时车驾幸杭州 其二","author":"赵鼎","text":"飘零泽国几春风，又触惊涛泛短篷。\n四海未知栖息地，百年半在别离中。\n功名元与世缘薄，兵火向来吾道穷。\n独倚危楼凄望眼，青山无数浙江东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14235,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喻弥陀收掩遗骸","author":"赵鼎","text":"骸骨鳞鳞旷野昏，天阴雨湿向谁论。\n纵然有乐踰南面，争似无为实相门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14236,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题常山草萍驿","author":"赵鼎","text":"才过常山到草萍，驿亭偏喜雨初晴。\n麦畦水涨黄云重，柳絮风吹白雪轻。\n身世自今忘俗虑，宦途从此快吟情。\n魏公已辍江西镇，犹有甘棠颂政声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14237,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山门栖岩寺","author":"赵鼎","text":"天边箭筈一门通，香隔云萝几万重。\n好借岩风为披拂，移文有语笑尘容。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14238,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"落花","author":"赵鼎","text":"花飞便觉春容减，一阵狂风满地红。\n可惜馀芳留不得，夜深人静月朦胧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14239,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"倦妆","author":"赵鼎","text":"锦帕新裁玩月犀，旋开妆合间云螭。\n一成贪耍慵梳洗，日晚惟添翠黛眉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14240,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"思乡","author":"赵鼎","text":"何意分南北，无由问死生。\n永缠风树感，深动渭阳情。\n两姊各衰白，诸甥未老成。\n尘烟渺湖海，恻恻寸心惊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14241,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题谒松陵三贤堂","author":"赵鼎","text":"垂虹过高岸，左江右湖水。\n洞庭相吐吞，沧海迷涯涘。\n长波卷风雨，莽苍穷南纪。\n人材钟秀颖，习俗擅清美。\n高风想三贤，足以振颓靡。\n一时挺孤标，千载照青史。\n荒祠倚桥侧，草草渔樵市。\n舟车往来冲，今谁踵前轨。\n我从都城出，万事空化委。\n就迹月重轻，心期要偷拟。\n异代岂无人，意欲从此始。\n山林与钟鼎，一决乃英伟。\n近闻北客言，兵戎缠巩汜。\n谁能务采纳，尚得扶隳毁。\n归欤固夙心，宁作一身喜。\n亦念征戍儿，白骨委荒垒。\n道路异秦吴，魂梦隔生死。\n江湖信清绝，浮泛聊尔耳。\n却坐写孤怀，悲风生绿绮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14242,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"道堂","author":"赵鼎","text":"疏松怪石水泠泠，白葛乌纱晚醉醒。\n想见眼前无俗物，一炉沉水写黄庭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14243,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"潇湘亭","author":"赵鼎","text":"绿柳平芜远际天，青山回抱水相连。\n半空梅雨昏窗色，一棹萍风破暝烟。\n酒到愁来那觉醉，诗逢佳客不论篇。\n只知身在将军府，一梦江南落枕边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14244,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"赵鼎","text":"速宜净扫妖氛了，来看钱塘八月潮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14245,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"赵鼎","text":"身骑箕尾归天上，气作山河壮本朝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14246,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"赵鼎","text":"颜斋在倅厅，面对逍遥楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14247,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"李邴","text":"涨海声中万状国商。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14248,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二首 其二","author":"释元素","text":"未开口时先分付，拟思量处隔千山。\n莫言佛法无多子，未透玄关也大难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14249,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二首 其二","author":"释安民","text":"三面狸奴手捉月，两头白牯脚拿烟。\n戴冠碧兔立庭柏，脱壳乌龟飞上天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14250,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古五首 其一","author":"释慧光","text":"雨洗淡红桃萼嫩，风摇浅碧柳丝轻。\n白云影里怪石露，绿水光中古木清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14251,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"坐睡","author":"曾几","text":"竹窗纳虚明，棐几亦滑净。\n幽人坐清秋，倦对古贤圣。\n丹田阅千息，一气忽空静。\n岂期黑甜乡，于此得栖径。\n倒床未必佳，邂逅乃复胜。\n觉来欠伸馀，两眼半开瞑。\n吾身竟何许，神意久方定。\n从此谢衾帷，蒲团日相倩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14252,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"放猿","author":"曾几","text":"孤猿锁槛岁年深，放出城南百丈林。\n绿水任从联臂饮，青山不用断肠吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14253,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"把酒思闲事二首 其一","author":"曾几","text":"把酒思闲事，春愁谁最深。\n乞钱羁客面，落第举人心。\n月下低眉立，灯前抱膝吟。\n凭君劝一醉，胜与万黄金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14254,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"把酒思闲事二首 其二","author":"曾几","text":"把酒思闲事，春娇何处多。\n试鞍新白马，弄镜小青娥。\n掌上初教舞，花头欲按歌。\n凭君劝一醉，劝了又如何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14255,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁寒亭","author":"曾几","text":"饱霜犹郁葱，立雪故清润。\n下有老成人，持心以相印。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14256,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"总持院","author":"郭印","text":"晓霁同登古息台，雨师先为洒尘埃。\n纹楸战罢仙踪杳，清磬音传佛寺开。\n门外老松迎客入，竹边高阁放山来。\n逡巡揽尽风光去，寄语三官不用猜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14257,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"御风桥","author":"郭印","text":"是身如虚空，风马时独御。\n青天手可扪，便欲飞腾去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14258,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戊申初寒偶作","author":"沈与求","text":"去年十月冬犹温，单衣晓出钱塘门。\n携孥仅脱饿虎口，更吟楚些招惊魂。\n儿女争从乱离苦，咿哑绕膝多语言。\n舟行畏涂侵夜泊，孤灯明灭何处村。\n萧萧细雨疏苇响，风力渐摇枯柳根。\n失声号寒泣龙具，促棹傍险争前奔。\n还家依然四壁立，故衾败絮那忍论。\n无衣岂暇具裘褐，海图坼裂波涛翻。\n天公戏人亦太虐，雪花径尺连上元。\n今年十月事羁宦，两脚如旧身大存。\n纸窗寂历风竹啸，古木中夜号空园。\n旅人不眠毛骨冷，抚事念往多烦冤。\n吾侪小人不论数，豺狼满目哀王孙。\n似闻易水寒堕指，北望大漠烟云昏。\n安得壮士驭八骏，沙虫猿鹤俱腾骞。\n归欤莫如中土乐，天子孝友朝廷尊。\n坐令铁衣扫虮虱，四海挟纩怀君恩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14259,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十里岩石壁","author":"沈与求","text":"巨灵手擘青瑶璞，平削无痕看斧凿。\n六丁取将天路遥，雷电收威半空落。\n至今崒嵂横道旁，绝壁万仞青茫茫。\n倚天屹立不可近，下视培塿如群羊。\n藓花斓斑风雨溃，藤梢夭矫蛟龙戏。\n中开微窦走鸣泉，白虹吞吐涵秋气。\n泉流万古潭水深，山寒无风郁沈沈。\n下田纳纳禾稼茂，发源沾溉初何心。\n峭直谁令据当路，松柏萧森半烟雾。\n犹恐夜深魑魅惊，更遣山灵谨呵护。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14260,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜书山驿","author":"沈与求","text":"天寒夜向阑，月出山更静。\n风露摇青空，万象光耿耿。\n啼螀泣幽草，宾鸿度前岭。\n归来坐孤窗，松竹舞清影。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14261,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绩溪寨口","author":"沈与求","text":"青嶂插天堑，白水翻地轴。\n回环壮哉县，不许飞鸟触。\n往年羽书驰，盗发清溪曲。\n先声杂妖幻，馀党萃符祝。\n控攘最旁近，被害良惨毒。\n聚落烬烟空，生齿涂炭酷。\n岂无山川险，会有法令束。\n百年不用武，骈领甘此辱。\n至今风雨夜，犹闻鬼群哭。\n遗俗感旧愤，禦盗勇气足。\n大儿佩刀剑，小儿利锋镞。\n老翁筋力衰，奋挺怒张目。\n营寨人自戍，不待官期促。\n矧今杀气横，洒涕国步蹙。\n豺狼据道路，虎兕出林谷。\n傥持复雠心，公战图报国。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14262,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻招寇","author":"沈与求","text":"绿林煽馀习，无乃国计左。\n诲盗爵秩崇，纳叛金缯夥。\n戢奸在斧钺，赏诱讵云可。\n萌芽缓诛锄，猖披费结裹。\n战多数招安，奚用腰箭笴。\n悍兵昔已然，黠将近亦颇。\n昌言假报国，涅面刺投火。\n豺狼奋哮噬，蜂虿利掀簸。\n横行入通邑，焚掠穷委琐。\n况闻南陵寇，执事初意惰。\n出没势已张，剪灭计未果。\n宣城俯百里，千室尽奔亸。\n王事吾有程，马头戴印颗。\n叱驭疾其驱，语言纷炙輠。\n何当说罴貅，一洗根本祸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14263,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宁国道中","author":"沈与求","text":"山石荦确行路难，山风萧萧吹早寒。\n十步九歇仆马瘁，兔蹊鸟道穷跻攀。\n崖谷空笼瀑泉走，碎玉零乱飞前滩。\n石堤捍水几百级，落处疑有蛟龙盘。\n两山之间开畎亩，石罅著锄那得宽。\n前村后村烟火冷，土墙茅盖常掩关。\n我行不知记近远，官游岁晚良自叹。\n岂如家家一饱外，鸡豚社酒相追欢。\n那知亦有简书畏，里胥剥啄惊衰颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":14264,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]